{
  "file": "module4",
  "page": 78,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        66.11469268798828,
        527.4747314453125,
        81.83369445800781
      ],
      "text": "(36) The cost–effectiveness study   found that, in most settings, BPaLM/BPaL is cost saving, mainly",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        80.59070587158203,
        527.39599609375,
        95.03370666503906
      ],
      "text": "because of reduced time in care and therefore reductions in numbers of outpatient visits, inpatient",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        93.79071807861328,
        524.1668701171875,
        108.23371887207031
      ],
      "text": "bed-days and laboratory tests. The panel judged that cost–effectiveness probably favours BPaLM/BPaL.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.94486141204834,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        124.63459014892578,
        258.4885559082031,
        140.29458618164062
      ],
      "text": "Equity, acceptability and feasibility",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        147.5025177001953,
        527.4287109375,
        161.9455108642578
      ],
      "text": "The panel considered the treatment duration and the ability to decentralize treatment (to enable",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        160.70252990722656,
        527.4331665039062,
        175.14552307128906
      ],
      "text": "access for remote, underserved settings and disadvantaged populations) to affect equity. Despite",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        173.9025421142578,
        527.4124145507812,
        188.3455352783203
      ],
      "text": "not being able to identify relevant research evidence, the panel used their collective experience to",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        187.10243225097656,
        527.39599609375,
        201.54542541503906
      ],
      "text": "judge that there would probably be advantages associated with the use of the BPaLM/BPaL regimen",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        200.3024444580078,
        527.437744140625,
        214.7454376220703
      ],
      "text": "owing to its reduced complexity and shorter duration. Therefore, the panel judged that use of the",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        213.5023956298828,
        316.21014404296875,
        227.9453887939453
      ],
      "text": "BPaLM/BPaL regimen would probably increase equity.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        233.93043518066406,
        524.4061889648438,
        249.64942932128906
      ],
      "text": "(37) A study on the acceptability and feasibility of the BPaL regimen from the provider perspective",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        248.4064483642578,
        527.4268188476562,
        262.8494567871094
      ],
      "text": "was considered to be relevant evidence for the assessment of BPaL and indirectly for the assessment",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        261.60638427734375,
        527.3165893554688,
        276.0494079589844
      ],
      "text": "of BPaLM. This was a mixed-methods study among a cross section of health care workers, and",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        274.806396484375,
        527.3805541992188,
        289.2494201660156
      ],
      "text": "programmatic and laboratory stakeholders that was carried out between May 2018 and May 2019",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        288.00628662109375,
        527.4267578125,
        302.4493103027344
      ],
      "text": "in Indonesia, Kyrgyzstan and Nigeria. The results from this study suggested that acceptability and",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        301.2064208984375,
        527.3927001953125,
        315.6494445800781
      ],
      "text": "feasibility overall were high. BPaL was rated as acceptable by more than 80% of participants across",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        314.40643310546875,
        527.279296875,
        328.8494567871094
      ],
      "text": "domains and stakeholders and 88% of interviewed stakeholders stated that they would probably",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        327.6064147949219,
        527.439697265625,
        342.0494384765625
      ],
      "text": "implement BPaL once it became available. Stakeholders appreciated that BPaL would reduce the",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        340.806396484375,
        527.2452392578125,
        355.2494201660156
      ],
      "text": "workload and financial burden on the health care system; expressed concerns about BPaL safety",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        354.00640869140625,
        527.53955078125,
        368.4494323730469
      ],
      "text": "(monitoring), long-term efficacy and national regulatory requirements; and stressed the importance of",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.963088035583496,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        367.2064208984375,
        527.3677368164062,
        381.6494445800781
      ],
      "text": "addressing current health systems constraints, especially in treatment and safety monitoring systems.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.993597984313965,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        379.1304016113281,
        527.3032836914062,
        394.84942626953125
      ],
      "text": "(38) Results from a second qualitative study   with a focus on the patient perspective were presented to",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 10.981684684753418,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        393.6064147949219,
        527.6069946289062,
        408.0494384765625
      ],
      "text": "the panel; this study suggested that patients would welcome the positive impact of shorter treatment",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.991096496582031,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        406.806396484375,
        182.30447387695312,
        421.2494201660156
      ],
      "text": "on employment status. 30",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        428.51031494140625,
        527.4278564453125,
        442.9533386230469
      ],
      "text": "The panel noted these study results and, as part of their deliberations, they considered patients and",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        441.7102966308594,
        527.4376220703125,
        456.1533203125
      ],
      "text": "health care providers as key stakeholders. The panel considered the following aspects to be critical",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        454.9103088378906,
        527.643798828125,
        469.35333251953125
      ],
      "text": "with regard to the acceptability of BPaLM/BPaL: regimen duration and drug-safety monitoring needs",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.998299598693848,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        468.1103210449219,
        527.26904296875,
        482.5533447265625
      ],
      "text": "(relating both to the necessary travel, loss of income and general disruption of the life of patients, and",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.981033325195312,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        481.310302734375,
        527.6111450195312,
        495.7533264160156
      ],
      "text": "to workload for the health care system), and the need for DST. The panel judged that the BPaLM/BPaL",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.978128433227539,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        494.51031494140625,
        527.3848266601562,
        508.9533386230469
      ],
      "text": "regimen would probably be acceptable. Regarding feasibility, the panel noted the limited availability",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        507.7103271484375,
        527.604736328125,
        522.1533203125
      ],
      "text": "of pure substances of drugs in the BPaLM/BPaL regimen for use in DST as a potential barrier to",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        520.9102783203125,
        527.3726806640625,
        535.353271484375
      ],
      "text": "implementation; they also noted that data on the critical concentration of pretomanid for use in DST",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        534.1103515625,
        524.402587890625,
        548.5533447265625
      ],
      "text": "are limited. However, given the reduced duration, complexity and associated workload of BPaLM/",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        547.310302734375,
        437.5313415527344,
        561.7532958984375
      ],
      "text": "BPaL, the panel judged that implementation of BPaLM/BPaL is probably feasible.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        575.1275024414062,
        325.3106384277344,
        590.9795532226562
      ],
      "text": "Evidence to recommendations: considerations",
      "font": "SegoeUI-BoldItalic",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        598.1875,
        527.5488891601562,
        612.6304931640625
      ],
      "text": "Based on the decisions taken during the review and the combination of assessments described above,",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.971012115478516,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        611.3873901367188,
        527.4597778320312,
        625.8303833007812
      ],
      "text": "the recommendation is to use the BPaLM regimen as the first choice in the defined patient group",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        624.5875244140625,
        527.4432983398438,
        639.030517578125
      ],
      "text": "with MDR/RR-TB, with the regimen to be used under routine programmatic conditions. Patients with",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        637.7874755859375,
        527.161376953125,
        652.23046875
      ],
      "text": "MDR/RR-TB who cannot use the BPaLM regimen, either due to ineligibility or unavailability of its",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        650.9874877929688,
        527.44287109375,
        665.4304809570312
      ],
      "text": "components, can instead be treated with 6-month BDLLfxC (see Recommendation 1.2) or one of the",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.997900009155273,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        182.9001007080078,
        664.0775146484375,
        466.02911376953125,
        678.4324951171875
      ],
      "text": "Treatment of drug-resistant TB using 9-month regimens",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        664.1875,
        527.4155883789062,
        678.6304931640625
      ],
      "text": "9-month regimens (see  ). The use of",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        239.0865936279297,
        677.2774047851562,
        505.64190673828125,
        691.6323852539062
      ],
      "text": "Treatment of drug-resistant TB using longer regimens",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        677.3873901367188,
        527.4240112304688,
        691.8303833007812
      ],
      "text": "the longer regimens is reserved (see ) for",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        690.5875244140625,
        527.4288940429688,
        705.030517578125
      ],
      "text": "individuals with MDR/RR-TB and fluoroquinolone resistance with further resistance or intolerance to",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        703.7874755859375,
        527.4134521484375,
        718.23046875
      ],
      "text": "bedaquiline, linezolid (XDR-TB) or pretomanid, and those with complicated extrapulmonary TB who",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        716.9874877929688,
        527.3980712890625,
        731.4304809570312
      ],
      "text": "would then receive a longer regimen designed with remaining effective medicines from Groups A, B",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        730.1875,
        407.65643310546875,
        744.6304931640625
      ],
      "text": "and C, according to their drug susceptibility profile and other parameters.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        759.4718017578125,
        357.7821960449219,
        773.17578125
      ],
      "text": "Unpublished, courtesy of Beverley Stringer, Manson unit, Médecins Sans Frontières. 30",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
